431
01:05:35.681 --> 01:05:37.974
I want you to know that,

432
01:05:39.060 --> 01:05:40.560
somehow,

433
01:05:41.729 --> 01:05:43.563
for some reason,

434
01:05:44.106 --> 01:05:45.774
