at least l'd like to know why.

447
01:06:30.444 --> 01:06:33.738
Just today I realize
how much I miss you.

448
01:06:34.615 --> 01:06:38.827
I hope to find you here
when I come back, willing to see me,

449
01:06:38.911 --> 01:06:41.204
