508
01:16:45.097 --> 01:16:47.088
Merry Christmas.

509
01:16:52.039 --> 01:16:54.171
Merry Christmas.

510
01:16:54.206 --> 01:16:58.267
Mine, mine...
everything is mine.

511
01:17:00.846 --> 01:17:03.151
Mine, mine, mine.

512
01:17:03.210 --> 01:17:04.910
Angel.

513
01:17:09.655 --> 01:17:11.384
Enough.

514
01:17:14.660 --> 01:17:17.561
